Configure DLSS Super Resolution, Ray Reconstruction, and Frame Generation settings.

Usage:
  spela dlss [command]

Available Commands:
  reset       Make a DLSS field follow All games
  set         Set DLSS configuration for a game
  show        Show DLSS configuration for a game

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for dlss

Use "spela dlss [command] --help" for more information about a command.
